    "introText": "Selling a house runs in seven stages. Plan the sale and your net proceeds, fix what inspectors will flag, and complete your disclosures. Then list and show the house, compare offers, manage the contract period, and close. This interactive tool adds the steps for your sale type, whether you hire an agent or sell on your own.\n\nUse the checklist builder below to generate your customized checklist. Select your home type, year built, selling method, occupancy status, and property features like pools or septic systems. The tool drops items that do not apply to your home and keeps the tasks you need. Click the \"Print or save as PDF\" button to print a clean worksheet or save it to your computer.",
