        "question": "Can I print this moving checklist or save it as a PDF?",
        "answer": "Yes, clicking the Print or save as PDF button formats your customized countdown onto a clean printable sheet with name, date, and address lines. In your browser's print dialog, choose your physical printer to create a paper worksheet. Alternatively, select Save as PDF to store a digital document directly on your device."
